	"teach_2_body": ["按住 {recall}（右键 / LB）一小会儿，时间就会变慢，红线会标出子弹刚才飞过的路线。看见那个白色靶子了吗？它现在正好挡在路上！", "Hold {recall} (RMB / LB) for a moment. Time slows and a red line marks the path your round just flew. See that white target? It's standing right on that path!"],
