	"chapter_6_sub": ["电是按贡献分的。第十三街的贡献，刚好够点一盏灯。", "POWER IS SHARED BY CONTRIBUTION. 13TH STREET'S IS JUST ENOUGH FOR ONE BULB."],
	"note_arcs": ["导电子弹 · 两颗子弹如果距离足够近，就会产生电弧。电弧会伤害敌人，也会伤害你，可以用冲刺穿过。", "LIVE ROUNDS · TWO ROUNDS CLOSE ENOUGH TOGETHER ARC. THE ARC HURTS ENEMIES AND YOU; DASH TO GET THROUGH."],
	"note_inspector": ["节能督导员 · 会让附近插在墙上的子弹失去能量，暂时无法回收。击败它后，子弹就会恢复正常，可以再次回收。", "ENERGY INSPECTOR · DRAINS ROUNDS STUCK IN NEARBY WALLS SO THEY CAN'T BE RECALLED FOR A WHILE. DEFEAT IT AND THEY WORK AGAIN."],
