	"note_shelves": ["密集档案架 · 档案架会按固定节奏左右移动，合拢时会造成伤害。可以等架子把子弹带到合适的位置，再使用回收。", "MOBILE SHELVING · THE SHELVES SLIDE LEFT AND RIGHT ON A FIXED RHYTHM AND HURT WHEN THEY CLOSE. WAIT FOR A SHELF TO CARRY YOUR ROUNDS INTO PLACE, THEN RECALL."],
	"note_proofreader": ["校对员 · 会重新排列嵌在墙上的子弹，改变它们的回收轨迹。被移动的子弹将停留在新位置，不会自动复原。", "PROOFREADER · REARRANGES THE ROUNDS IN THE WALLS AND CHANGES THEIR RECALL PATHS. MOVED ROUNDS STAY WHERE THEY ARE PUT."],
	"corrected": ["已更正", "CORRECTED"],
	"boss_archivist": ["档案修订机", "THE ARCHIVIST"],
	"note_boss_archivist": ["涂黑条会横扫战场，接触的子弹将被暂时删除。抽屉开启时会暴露核心，利用回收攻击核心。最后，它将开始修订一份特殊档案。", "BLACK BARS SWEEP THE FIELD AND DELETE ANY ROUNDS THEY TOUCH FOR A WHILE. AN OPEN DRAWER EXPOSES THE CORE: RECALL INTO IT. AT THE END, IT STARTS REVISING A SPECIAL FILE."],
