	"chapter_9": ["天穹轨道电梯", "THE SKY LIFT"],
	"chapter_9_sub": ["这条通道直达轨道。参与建设的人可以光荣地从观景层看着它载着重点股东缓缓升空。", "THIS SHAFT RUNS STRAIGHT TO ORBIT. THOSE WHO BUILT IT MAY PROUDLY WATCH FROM THE VIEWING DECK AS IT CARRIES THE KEY SHAREHOLDERS UP."],
	"note_vents": ["减压舱门 · 舱门开启时会产生强大吸力，将玩家和子弹拉向门口。附近嵌在墙上的子弹也会被吸过去，可以趁子弹聚集时一次性回收。", "AIRLOCKS · AN OPEN DOOR PULLS HARD, DRAGGING YOU AND YOUR ROUNDS TOWARD IT. ROUNDS IN NEARBY WALLS GET PULLED OVER TOO: RECALL THEM ALL AT ONCE WHILE THEY ARE BUNCHED UP."],
