	"boss_counterweight": ["配重块", "THE COUNTERWEIGHT"],
	"note_boss_counterweight": ["配重装置 · 地面不断扩大的阴影标示着坠落位置。配重落地后，底部核心会短暂暴露，利用回收攻击核心。进入后阶段，将有两块配重同时坠落。", "COUNTERWEIGHT · A GROWING SHADOW ON THE FLOOR MARKS WHERE IT WILL DROP. ONCE IT LANDS, ITS CORE IS EXPOSED FOR A MOMENT: RECALL INTO IT. LATER, TWO COUNTERWEIGHTS FALL AT ONCE."],
	"radio_counterweight": ["轨道电梯运行正常。请观景层乘客远离配重作业区。", "THE LIFT IS RUNNING NORMALLY. VIEWING-DECK PASSENGERS, PLEASE KEEP AWAY FROM THE COUNTERWEIGHT AREA."],
