	"chapter_10": ["近地轨道军工船坞", "THE ORBITAL ARMS YARD"],
	"chapter_10_sub": ["这座船厂没有休息日。它却坚持给每一艘都取个带有“和平”的名字。", "THIS YARD NEVER TAKES A DAY OFF. YET IT INSISTS ON GIVING EVERY SHIP A NAME WITH 'PEACE' IN IT."],
	"note_plates": ["漂浮船板 · 玩家射击可以推开船体板，回收嵌入其中的子弹则会将它猛地拉回。找准角度，用整块船体板撞击敌人。", "HULL PLATES ADRIFT · SHOOT A PLATE TO PUSH IT AWAY; RECALL A ROUND STUCK IN IT AND THE PLATE IS YANKED BACK. FIND THE ANGLE AND RAM ENEMIES WITH IT."],
	"note_escort": ["护航无人机 · 会环绕其他敌人飞行，替它们拦截回收中的子弹。优先击毁无人机，或调整回收角度，绕过它的防护。", "ESCORT DRONE · CIRCLES OTHER ENEMIES AND BLOCKS RETURNING ROUNDS FOR THEM. TAKE OUT THE DRONE FIRST, OR CHANGE YOUR RECALL ANGLE TO GET AROUND IT."],
	"boss_peace": ["在建战舰 · 和平股东号", "THE PEACE SHAREHOLDER (UNDER CONSTRUCTION)"],
	"note_boss_peace": ["战争装配机 · 机械臂会持续为核心安装装甲和炮塔。趁装甲尚未覆盖，攻击暴露的结构，阻止它完成组装。装配进度越高，炮塔数量越多，火力也越强。", "WAR ASSEMBLER · ITS ARMS KEEP FITTING ARMOUR AND TURRETS TO THE CORE. HIT THE EXPOSED FRAME BEFORE THE ARMOUR COVERS IT TO STOP THE BUILD. THE FURTHER IT GETS, THE MORE TURRETS AND THE HEAVIER THE FIRE."],
	"radio_peace": ["和平号进入总装。请勿干扰和平建设。", "THE PEACE ENTERS FINAL ASSEMBLY. DO NOT OBSTRUCT THE BUILDING OF PEACE."],
