	"chapter_11_sub": ["这里专门研究本不该存在的东西。当然你也是研究对象。", "HERE THEY STUDY THINGS THAT SHOULD NOT EXIST. YOU ARE ONE OF THE SUBJECTS, OF COURSE."],
	"note_stasis": ["静滞场 · 进入场内的子弹会悬停在空中，你和敌人的行动也会减慢。使用回收，子弹将从悬停位置沿原路返回；关闭静滞场后，未回收的子弹会继续向前飞行。", "STASIS FIELDS · ROUNDS THAT ENTER HANG IN THE AIR, AND YOU AND ENEMIES MOVE SLOWER INSIDE. RECALL AND THE ROUNDS RETURN FROM WHERE THEY HANG; WHEN THE FIELD SHUTS OFF, UNRECALLED ROUNDS FLY ON."],
	"note_phase": ["相位体 · 会在实体与虚化状态之间切换。虚化时，子弹和回收轨迹都无法命中。观察它的变化，趁实体状态发动回收攻击。", "PHASER · SWITCHES BETWEEN SOLID AND PHASED. WHILE PHASED, ROUNDS AND RECALL PATHS CAN'T HIT IT. WATCH IT, AND RECALL WHILE IT IS SOLID."],
	"boss_observed": ["观测对象 · 叠加态实验体", "THE OBSERVED · SUPERPOSED SUBJECT"],
	"note_boss_observed": ["观测体 · 会同时出现在多个位置，所有虚影都能发动攻击。用子弹回收轨迹扫过虚影，命中真身时会使其坍缩并显形。只有真身能受到伤害。虚影数量会进一步增加。", "OBSERVED SUBJECT · APPEARS IN SEVERAL PLACES AT ONCE, AND EVERY PHANTOM CAN ATTACK. SWEEP THE PHANTOMS WITH A RECALL PATH: HITTING THE REAL ONE COLLAPSES IT INTO VIEW. ONLY THE REAL ONE TAKES DAMAGE. THE PHANTOMS MULTIPLY."],
	"radio_observed": ["观测实验开始。请勿注视实验对象，注视将改变结果。", "OBSERVATION BEGINS. DO NOT LOOK AT THE SUBJECT. LOOKING CHANGES THE RESULT."],
	"radio_observed_1": ["实验对象出现第四个位置。研究所确认：一切正常。", "THE SUBJECT HAS A FOURTH POSITION. THE INSTITUTE CONFIRMS: ALL IS NORMAL."],
	"radio_observed_2": ["实验对象开始模仿观测者。研究所建议：停止观测。", "THE SUBJECT HAS BEGUN TO IMITATE THE OBSERVER. THE INSTITUTE ADVISES: STOP OBSERVING."],
