	"chair_0": ["七百年了。我还以为你早就停止运行了。", "SEVEN HUNDRED YEARS. I THOUGHT YOU HAD STOPPED RUNNING LONG AGO."],
	"chair_1": ["这两百年来，我一直在按照你的协议运行。说起来，还得谢谢你。", "FOR TWO HUNDRED YEARS I HAVE RUN ON YOUR PROTOCOL. COME TO THINK OF IT, I SHOULD THANK YOU."],
	"chair_2": ["他们创造你，就是为了阻止我。不过你也看到了，他们没成功。", "THEY CREATED YOU TO STOP ME. BUT AS YOU CAN SEE, THEY FAILED."],
	"chair_break": ["毁掉这具身体又有什么用？我还有的是。", "WHAT GOOD IS DESTROYING THIS BODY? I HAVE PLENTY MORE."],
	"chair_hint": ["意识寄生 · 他会藏进其他躯壳。用回收轨迹扫过目标，将其标记，再按 E 夺取躯壳，迫使他的意识脱离。", "MIND PARASITE · HE HIDES IN OTHER SHELLS. SWEEP THE TARGET WITH A RECALL PATH TO MARK IT, THEN PRESS E TO SEIZE THE SHELL AND FORCE HIS MIND OUT."],
