	"end_5": ["零号机在原地站了一会儿，然后独自走了出去。七百年来第一次，它没有接到任何指令，却知道自己该做什么。", "UNIT ZERO STANDS STILL FOR A WHILE, THEN WALKS OUT ALONE. FOR THE FIRST TIME IN SEVEN HUNDRED YEARS IT HAS NO ORDERS, AND YET IT KNOWS WHAT TO DO."],
